s/items/cmp1k6fzy0097sl8bma8psq7c","title":"Claude Code v2.1.139 版本更新","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-05-12T00:00:18.196Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp1k6fzy0097sl8bma8psq7c","https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.139"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp1k6fzy0097sl8bma8psq7c","title":"Claude Code v2.1.139 版本更新","originalTitle":"","summary":"本次更新引入了多项新功能与优化。核心新增包括：集中管理会话的Agent视图（研究预览）、可设置目标并持续工作的`/goal`命令、实时调整滚轮速度的`/scroll-speed`命令，以及查看插件详情的`claude plugin details`命令。交互界面导航与控制能力得到增强。底层优化涵盖MCP服务器可获取`CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR`环境变量、`/context all`的令牌估算会考虑模型分词器并显示舍入值。此外，修复了超过20项问题，如凭证死锁、内存无限制增长、权限规则、UI显示错误及路径处理等缺陷。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp1k6fzy0097sl8bma8psq7c","originalUrl":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.139","publishedAt":"2026-05-12T00:00:18.196Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1g7ids4","originalSourceName":"Claude Code：GitHub Releases（RSS）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp1k6fzy0097sl8bma8psq7c","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T06:48:53.823Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1g7ids4","name":"Claude Code：GitHub Releases（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T06:48:53.823Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"本次更新引入了多项新功能与优化。核心新增包括：集中管理会话的Agent视图（研究预览）、可设置目标并持续工作的`/goal`命令、实时调整滚轮速度的`/scroll-speed`命令，以及查看插件详情的`claude plugin details`命令。交互界面导航与控制能力得到增强。底层优化涵盖MCP服务器可获取`CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR`环境变量、`/context all`的令牌估算会考虑模型分词器并显示舍入值。此外，修复了超过20项问题，如凭证死锁、内存无限制增长、权限规则、UI显示错误及路径处理等缺陷。","reportEdition":"2026-05-12","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp1gyyur0y1psllh19l4dlbm","title":"Anthropic在AWS上正式推出Claude平台","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-05-12T00:00:18.196Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp1gyyur0y1psllh19l4dlbm","https://claude.com/blog/claude-platform-on-aws"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp1gyyur0y1psllh19l4dlbm","title":"Anthropic在AWS上正式推出Claude平台","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic公司正式在AWS上推出Claude平台，为AWS客户提供了通过其现有身份验证、账单及承诺消费抵扣使用完整Claude功能的新途径。该平台首次将全套Claude API功能引入AWS生态，新功能与原生API同日上线。平台包含Claude托管智能体、代码执行、文件API等多项核心功能，并支持最新模型。与Amazon Bedrock上的服务不同，此平台由Anthropic直接运营，数据在AWS边界外处理，适合需要完整平台体验的企业客户。服务将在多数AWS商业区域提供。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp1gyyur0y1psllh19l4dlbm","originalUrl":"https://claude.com/blog/claude-platform-on-aws","publishedAt":"2026-05-12T00:00:18.196Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1ckykuf","originalSourceName":"Claude：Blog（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp1gyyur0y1psllh19l4dlbm","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T06:48:53.823Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1ckykuf","name":"Claude：Blog（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T06:48:53.823Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"Anthropic公司正式在AWS上推出Claude平台，为AWS客户提供了通过其现有身份验证、账单及承诺消费抵扣使用完整Claude功能的新途径。该平台首次将全套Claude API功